Dependency discovery covers quoted relative imports, literal local resources and uppercase QML type names matched to filenames; it is not a complete Qt/QML linker.
Qt modules, C++ plugins, singleton registration, qmldir type aliases, dynamic Loader URLs and runtime-generated resources may need additional upstream inspection.
The report does not prove which tree is currently rendered on screen; source provenance and runtime visual comparison remain separate.
Binary assets are represented by path, size and SHA-256, not embedded.
Report contains local source text, paths, package versions and host label; review/redact before publishing.
No system configuration, package, service, authentication, permission or Git state was modified.
